  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize winning tricks that contain high-value doubles (6-6 is 12 points, 5-5 is 10 points). These are the 'Volle' of the game.\n\nCounting: There are only 28 tiles. Track which trumps have been played to know if your Bingo is the last remaining master tile.\n\nClosing the Stock: If you have a strong hand of trumps and believe you can reach 70 points without drawing more, close the stock. This forces your opponent to follow suit, potentially trapping their high-value doubles.",
